Name restriction of the original project
----------------------------------------

The README of the HestiaCP project states that the names "Hestia Control
Panel" and "HestiaCP" and the Hestia logo are original copyright of
hestiacp.com and must not be used for redistributed or derived products. For
this reason VylarisSpace does not use these names or the Hestia logo in its
user interface, in e-mails sent to customers or in its documentation for
users. Internal identifiers (program paths, service and user names, command
names, configuration file names and similar) keep the historic name "hestia"
so that the system and merges from upstream keep working. Copyright notices and
license headers of the original authors are kept in the source files.

