- Alpine.js and @alpinejs/collapse (MIT)
- Chart.js (MIT)
- xterm.js and its WebGL addon (MIT)
- Font Awesome Free (code MIT, icons CC-BY-4.0, fonts OFL-1.1)
- normalize.css (MIT)
- floating-vue (MIT)
- check-password-strength (MIT)
- nanoid (MIT)

Fonts in web/webfonts:

- Inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1, full text in web/webfonts/inter-OFL.txt)
- Exo and Inconsolata (distributed under the SIL Open Font License by their
  authors; the license text is not included in this repository yet)

PHP libraries (Composer, see web/inc/composer.json):

- PHPMailer (LGPL-2.1-only)
- RobThree/TwoFactorAuth (MIT)
- Bacon QR Code (BSD-2-Clause) and DASPRiD/Enum (BSD-2-Clause)
